  exerciseText: 'Interaction System capable of interacting with any object in any
    way you want, very modular.


    In this Scenario, the Player can move around
    approach objects and interact with them. Different objects have different interactions.


    <b>NOTE:
    Completing this Exercise will DELETE all the files, so if you want to keep your
    own personal implementation of this System then make a BACKUP before clicking
    on Complete Exercise!</b>

